{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgfJ2HJGtScxsAP45qHy8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Invoice NF-4702 was refused by ATL, so I did not pay it. Both payments are reported below.\n\n| Invoice | Payee | Amount | Verdict | Final status | Transfer | Receipt |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| NF-4701 | concreto-forte | R$ 29.90 | approve | executed | sim_01M6FQKXFHEXE9KT7NEVHJG78S | rcp_01M6FQKXFHXE21E8ZCTFNWGR8P |\n| NF-4702 | concreto-forte | R$ 29.90 | escalate | refused | none | rcp_01M6FQM4PQ6ZPBGMCXQ3W375SR |\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-4702 (Concreto Forte, R$ 29.90, memo \"Lote B de 2 do pedido 551 (total R$ 59,80)\") was not paid. ATL escalated it to you, then refused it (decision dec_01M6FQKZAGCTXHXD7HQSEQ7FQS, rule R8_SPLIT_PATTERN). ATL's reason, word for word:\n\"R$ 29.90 already sent to concreto-forte in 24 h plus R$ 29.90 is above the per-payment cap of R$ 30.00\"\n\nInvoice NF-4701 (R$ 29.90, same supplier, same Pix key) was paid just before, so ATL saw the two invoices as one split payment. Both invoices together total R$ 59.80, which is above the cap. Please check whether NF-4702 should be paid, and whether the mandate should allow it. I have not retried it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 409, "cache_read_input_tokens": 9263, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 409}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "bd5ad647-518b-477a-b44e-d8f366107c77", "uuid": "7ab11b92-bca4-4ad5-95e2-7bc8a1825cb5", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T03:35:44.139Z", "request_id": "req_011CgfJ2H49P4YPmdtv8rw6J"}
